///
/// Changing who exists here also means updating <c>docs/demo/maple-ridge-demo-district.md</c> and its
/// login spreadsheet, which are snapshots of this roster. <see cref="Validate"/> catches the
/// contradictions a roster edit can introduce; <c>DemoRosterTests</c> runs it.
